When the user wants receipted LLM calls or public URL fetch, use the
Metrecept MCP tools (`metrecept_chat`, `metrecept_fetch_web`,
`metrecept_session`).

Identical canonical requests HIT (exact-match Redis replay). Unique calls
MISS. Prefix overlap is labelled and is not a HIT. Do not claim semantic
cache, loop-killer, or invented savings percentages.

Stdio: `pip install "git+https://github.com/iwasinnam2/metrecept-opensource.git#subdirectory=packages/metrecept-mcp"`,
then `metrecept-mcp` with `METRECEPT_API_KEY` (`sk-at-…` from
https://metrecept.co.uk/billing/intermediate). `pip install metrecept-mcp`
also works. There is no `sk-metre-` key prefix.

Hosted: `https://api.metrecept.co.uk/mcp` with
`Authorization: Bearer sk-at-…`.
